OL,3,GNEWSAStudent drowned after leaving
OL,4,Aambulance - inquest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student was assessed by an ambulance
OL,7,Fcrew hours before he died after falling
OL,8,Finto a river, a coroner has said.
OL,10,FAryan Sharma, 20, was last seen out in
OL,11,FLoughborough town centre in
OL,12,FLeicestershire on 21 November, and into
OL,13,Fthe early hours of 22 November.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
